{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-11","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-11"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810901-line","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-11","missionId":"event-rogue-11","mission":"사채발행기 (1)","scene":"사채발행기 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"스타피스 컴퍼니 이사회의 이사 「흉터 부인」이 당신의 맞은편에 앉아있다. 왼쪽 눈에 기다란 흉터가 난 그녀가 당신을 관찰하는 시선이 느껴진다. 결코 쉬운 상대가 아니란 걸 알 수 있다","talkId":403810901,"textHash":"17317928600798693569","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:11/talk-403810901","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"da1e8e5efbc503c1","bwikiNextIds":["simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810902-line"],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其一）","bwikiRevision":58889,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9525","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (1)"},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810902-line","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-11","missionId":"event-rogue-11","mission":"사채발행기 (1)","scene":"사채발행기 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"그녀의 강력한 위압감에 당신은 그대로 앉아있는다. 하녀가 샴페인을 서빙하며 흉터 부인의 손등에 가볍게 키스한다","talkId":403810902,"textHash":"2101448888964682566","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:11/talk-403810902","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"da1e8e5efbc503c1","bwikiNextIds":["simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810903-line"],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其一）","bwikiRevision":58889,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9525","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (1)"},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810903-line","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-11","missionId":"event-rogue-11","mission":"사채발행기 (1)","scene":"사채발행기 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「아이베리 행성에 금융위기가 불어닥쳤다더군」 흉터 부인이 말한다. 「사업통합부에서는 행성이 위기를 돌파할 수 있도록 천사형 사채발행기를 출시했어. 당신에게 거절할 수 없는 조건을 제시하겠네」","talkId":403810903,"textHash":"529465178981863401","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:11/talk-403810903","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"da1e8e5efbc503c1","bwikiNextIds":["simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810904-line"],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其一）","bwikiRevision":58889,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9525","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (1)"},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810904-line","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-11","missionId":"event-rogue-11","mission":"사채발행기 (1)","scene":"사채발행기 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「컴퍼니의 채무를 구입해 떠맡아주면 이번 위기가 지나가고 난 뒤에 수십 배는 되는 보답을 안겨주겠네」","talkId":403810904,"textHash":"10780387430727240206","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:11/talk-403810904","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"da1e8e5efbc503c1","bwikiNextIds":["simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810905-line"],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其一）","bwikiRevision":58889,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9525","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (1)"},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810905-line","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-11","missionId":"event-rogue-11","mission":"사채발행기 (1)","scene":"사채발행기 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"흉터 부인의 곁에 서 있던 하인이 날개가 달린 천사형 사채발행기를 꺼낸다. 「천사형 사채발행기에 정기적으로 갖고 있는 골드를 집어넣으면 머신이 투자 금액을 기록할 거야. 그리고 투자 기간이 끝나면 당신은 보답으로 투자 금액의 수십 배를 얻게 되는 거지」","talkId":403810905,"textHash":"6564044776191164310","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:11/talk-403810905","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"da1e8e5efbc503c1","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其一）","bwikiRevision":58889,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9525","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (1)"},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-text-3246110309837087709-choice","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-11","missionId":"event-rogue-11","mission":"사채발행기 (1)","scene":"사채발행기 (1)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"살래","talkId":null,"textHash":"3246110309837087709","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:11/text-3246110309837087709","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"4dab70ae65285be1","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其一）","bwikiRevision":58889,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9525","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (1)"},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-text-18069847593110393558-choice","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-11","missionId":"event-rogue-11","mission":"사채발행기 (1)","scene":"사채발행기 (1)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"넌 신뢰할 만한 *투자 매니저*가 아니야","talkId":null,"textHash":"18069847593110393558","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:11/text-18069847593110393558","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"ba31ce5d2717ff9c","bwikiNextIds":["simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-text-16204272535736638548-effect"],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其一）","bwikiRevision":58889,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9525","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (1)"},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-text-16204272535736638548-effect","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-11","missionId":"event-rogue-11","mission":"사채발행기 (1)","scene":"사채발행기 (1)","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"스타피스 컴퍼니는 절대 자선가가 아니다!","talkId":null,"textHash":"16204272535736638548","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:11/text-16204272535736638548","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"ba31ce5d2717ff9c","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其一）","bwikiRevision":58889,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9525","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (1)","bwikiReplyToIds":["simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-text-18069847593110393558-choice"]},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810909-line","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-11","missionId":"event-rogue-11","mission":"사채발행기 (1)","scene":"사채발행기 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「당신은 자신이 뭘 놓친 건지 모르는군」 흉터 부인이 말한다. 「노동자라면 누구나 이 기회를 놓치지 않으려고 안간힘을 쓰지. 지금은 *투기주의*의 시대란 걸 잊으면 안 돼」","talkId":403810909,"textHash":"7370301111369734051","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:11/talk-403810909","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"53a8040ccad0c391","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其一）","bwikiRevision":58889,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9525","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (1)"},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-text-913224582212446178-choice","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-11","missionId":"event-rogue-11","mission":"사채발행기 (1)","scene":"사채발행기 (1)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"난 이 시대가 싫어","talkId":null,"textHash":"913224582212446178","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:11/text-913224582212446178","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"5589493538fd828f","bwikiNextIds":["simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-text-14142522594679965459-effect"],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其一）","bwikiRevision":58889,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9525","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (1)"},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-text-14142522594679965459-effect","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-11","missionId":"event-rogue-11","mission":"사채발행기 (1)","scene":"사채발행기 (1)","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"그것은 내가 *결여*됐다는 느낌을 준다","talkId":null,"textHash":"14142522594679965459","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:11/text-14142522594679965459","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"5589493538fd828f","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其一）","bwikiRevision":58889,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9525","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (1)","bwikiReplyToIds":["simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-text-913224582212446178-choice"]},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810911-line","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-11","missionId":"event-rogue-11","mission":"사채발행기 (1)","scene":"사채발행기 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「우린 당신의 부족한 부분을 채워줄 수 있어. 원하는 것을 얻을 수 있는 *기회*를 제공해 준다는 말이지」 흉터 부인이 말한다","talkId":403810911,"textHash":"5371159058014070128","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:11/talk-403810911","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"8e700210d43e6dbd","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其一）","bwikiRevision":58889,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9525","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (1)"},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-text-12799863701323063899-choice","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-11","missionId":"event-rogue-11","mission":"사채발행기 (1)","scene":"사채발행기 (1)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"난 돈을 원해","talkId":null,"textHash":"12799863701323063899","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:11/text-12799863701323063899","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"fa88c7df9b1e969f","bwikiNextIds":["simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810913-line"],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其一）","bwikiRevision":58889,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9525","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (1)"},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810913-line","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-11","missionId":"event-rogue-11","mission":"사채발행기 (1)","scene":"사채발행기 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「물론 당신이 ok만 한다면 10배 이상의 투자 수익률을 거둘 수 있을 거야. *물질*적인 부분이 부족한 걸 알고 있어. 우리는 클리포트의 가호를 받고 있지」 흉터 부인이 말한다","talkId":403810913,"textHash":"12767416437569704784","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:11/talk-403810913","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"fa88c7df9b1e969f","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其一）","bwikiRevision":58889,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9525","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (1)","bwikiReplyToIds":["simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-text-12799863701323063899-choice"]},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-text-8554672098801626020-choice","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-11","missionId":"event-rogue-11","mission":"사채발행기 (1)","scene":"사채발행기 (1)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"*사랑*을 원해","talkId":null,"textHash":"8554672098801626020","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:11/text-8554672098801626020","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"0544462b9c9dddaf","bwikiNextIds":["simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810915-line"],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其一）","bwikiRevision":58889,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9525","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (1)"},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810915-line","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-11","missionId":"event-rogue-11","mission":"사채발행기 (1)","scene":"사채발행기 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「물론 사랑은 우주의 통용 화폐이고, 우리는 그걸 양산 중이야. 스타피스 컴퍼니는 대중들에게 영원히 멈추지 않는 사랑을 제공하려 노력 중이고 우리는 클리포트의 가호를 받고 있지」 흉터 부인이 말한다","talkId":403810915,"textHash":"652123512502134710","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:11/talk-403810915","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"0544462b9c9dddaf","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其一）","bwikiRevision":58889,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9525","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (1)","bwikiReplyToIds":["simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-text-8554672098801626020-choice"]},{"id":"simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-text-15713554309920511529-choice","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"event-rogue-11","missionId":"event-rogue-11","mission":"사채발행기 (1)","scene":"사채발행기 (1)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"아무것도 원하지 않아. 이건 허무해","talkId":null,"textHash":"15713554309920511529","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:11/text-15713554309920511529","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"52192412c6828996","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"谢债发行机（其一）","bwikiRevision":58889,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9525","bwikiMission":"사채발행기 (1)"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810901-line","simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810902-line","simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810903-line","simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810904-line","simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-talk-403810905-line","simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-text-3246110309837087709-choice","simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-text-18069847593110393558-choice","simulated-universe-event-rogue-11-text-16204272535736638548-effect","simulated-